      "side": 1,
      "message": "We found that when the server is the process of system_server, it will have many references, and the traversal will be time-consuming. There are not so many references to other servers, so the default method is still used to create binder_ref for other servers. We will first conduct experiments to see whether bitmap replacing red-black tree traversal will bring additional overhead in ordinary low-load scenarios. If not, we will upstream later.",
